sequenceDiagram
  title Student pays for a booking
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js<br/>web app
  box rgb(245, 247, 250) Express backend
    participant API as HTTP layer<br/>(router and controller)
    participant Booking as Booking<br/>service
    participant Wallet as Wallet<br/>ledger
    participant Notify as Notifications<br/>and email adapter
  end
  participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(via Prisma)

  Student->>Web: Pay(bookingId)
  Web->>+API: POST confirm-payment<br/>(bookingId, bearer token)
  API->>API: Authenticate and validate(bookingId)
  API->>+Booking: confirmBookingPayment(<br/>userId, bookingId)
  Note over Booking,DB: Preparation: settle eligible earnings and expire stale payment attempts

  rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
    Note over Booking,DB: One serializable database transaction
    Booking->>+DB: Begin transaction and load Booking/slots
    DB-->>Booking: Unpaid Booking and available slots
    Booking->>Booking: Check owner, payment deadline, and slots
    Booking->>DB: Claim slots and confirm Booking
    Booking->>+Wallet: appendWalletMovement(tx,<br/>LESSON_PAYMENT)
    Wallet->>DB: Debit wallet and append LESSON_PAYMENT
    Wallet-->>-Booking: Payment recorded
    Booking->>DB: Load confirmed Booking and commit
    DB-->>-Booking: Committed
  end

  Note over Booking,Notify: Notify only after commit, delivery failure does not undo payment
  Booking->>+Notify: notifyUser(Student and Tutor, booking)
  Notify->>DB: Read recipients and<br/>notification preferences
  Notify->>Notify: [enabled] Send booking emails
  Notify-->>-Booking: Delivery attempt settled
  Booking-->>-API: Confirmed Booking
  API-->>-Web: Confirmed Booking JSON
  Web-->>Student: Show Confirmed and<br/>updated wallet balance
